    "updated_at": "2016-08-22T13:01:05Z",
    "body": "It would end up being the same as if the element was compared to its child. So the problem is the addition of DOCUMENT_POSITION_CONTAIN[S|EN_BY].\n\nSo would a fix here by that step 7 and 8 also check that attr1 and attr2 are null?\n",
