    "created_at": "2016-08-24T08:13:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-24T08:13:05Z",
    "body": "The TreatShadowTreesAsComposed case is only used for an internal call site, from scripts one will get TreatShadowTreesAsDisconnected which (presumably) maintains the old behavior.\n\nStill might be worthwhile adding a note about this or at the very least making sure there's something in web-platform-tests ensuring that everyone agrees on how to handle ShadowRoots.\n",
